// LateClassVarReadActor — test fixture for BT-3549 (ADR 0124 §3/B3)
//
// Class-side counterpart to LateFieldReadActor: a `late classState:` var,
// read from a class method, must guard the same way as an instance `late
// state:` field — `self.current` in a class method compiles to a guarded
// `maps:find` against `ClassVars` (`generate_field_access`'s class-method
// branch, `expressions.rs:526-537`).
//
// Stays unassigned for the whole test run — a class variable's `ClassVars`
// map is owned by the class's own long-lived gen_server process, not reset
// between test methods the way a fresh `spawn` gives each instance test its
// own state. See `late_class_var_assigned_actor.bt` for the "assign then
// read" counterpart, kept as a separate class so the two tests can't
// interfere with each other's order.

typed Actor subclass: LateClassVarReadActor
  late classState: current :: Integer
  classState: total :: Integer = 0

  class getCurrent -> Integer => self.current

  class getTotal -> Integer => self.total
